{
  "// what": "The Family Portal v3 design's sample copy that is really data, and its binding. See tools/dc-compile.js.",
  "Prototype: try code 482913 with the name “Bisi”.": "The code is on their member app, under Me → Family. After a few wrong tries we pause for 15 minutes.",
  "<div style=\"padding:8px 16px 4px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n              <sc-for list=\"{{ ttShown }}\"": "<div style=\"padding:{{ ttPad }}; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n              <sc-for list=\"{{ ttShown }}\"",
  "// top": "On a phone the top is ONE bar: the child switcher (who and how they are today) on the left, what needs you and the account on the right. The design's logo row and the page header's repeat of the child's avatar and name cost ~90px on every screen; the sub-tabs stay in reach when a section scrolls.",
  "      <header style=\"flex-shrink:0; background:#f6f4f0; padding:{{ topPad }} 14px 8px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5dd;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\"><img src=\"assets/logo.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:50%;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:17px; flex:1;\">NGG Family</span><button onClick=\"{{ toAccount }}\" aria-label=\"Your account\" style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; display:grid; place-items:center;\"><span style=\"width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; background:#0b0b0c; color:#f5b026; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600;\">{{ gIni }}</span></button></div>\n        <button onClick=\"{{ openSw }}\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Switch child\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; min-height:56px; padding:8px 12px 8px 8px; border:1px solid #e8e5dd; border-radius:16px; background:#fff; text-align:left; width:100%;\">\n          <span style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ cur.tone }}; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; flex-shrink:0; position:relative;\">{{ cur.ini }}<span style=\"position:absolute; right:-1px; bottom:-1px; width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ cur.dot }}; border:2px solid #fff;\"></span></span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><b style=\"font-size:15px; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;\">{{ cur.name }}</b><span style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:{{ cur.sc }}; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;\">{{ cur.sub }}</span></span>\n          <sc-if value=\"{{ multi }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px; font-weight:500; color:#3a3a40; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; white-space:nowrap;\">Switch<i class=\"ph ph-caret-up-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></sc-if>\n          <sc-if value=\"{{ cur.hasAlerts }}\"><span style=\"min-width:22px; height:22px; padding:0 7px; border-radius:999px; background:#f5b026; color:#2a1d00; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">{{ cur.alerts }}</span></sc-if>\n        </button>\n      </header>": "      <header style=\"flex-shrink:0; background:#f6f4f0; padding:8px 10px 8px 12px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e5dd;\">\n        <button onClick=\"{{ openSw }}\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"{{ swAria }}\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; min-height:52px; padding:6px 10px 6px 6px; border:0; border-radius:14px; background:transparent; text-align:left;\">\n          <span style=\"width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ cur.tone }}; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; flex-shrink:0; position:relative;\">{{ cur.ini }}<span style=\"position:absolute; right:-1px; bottom:-1px; width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ cur.dot }}; border:2px solid #f6f4f0;\"></span></span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><b style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden;\"><span style=\"overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;\">{{ cur.name }}</span><sc-if value=\"{{ multi }}\"><i class=\"ph ph-caret-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:#4a4a50; flex-shrink:0;\"></i></sc-if></b><span style=\"font-size:13px; color:{{ cur.sc }}; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis;\">{{ cur.sub }}</span></span>\n        </button>\n        <sc-if value=\"{{ hasNeeds }}\"><button onClick=\"{{ toNeeds }}\" aria-label=\"{{ needsH }}\" style=\"position:relative; width:44px; height:44px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; display:grid; place-items:center; flex-shrink:0;\"><i class=\"ph ph-bell-simple\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:24px;\"></i><span style=\"position:absolute; top:4px; right:2px; min-width:20px; height:20px; padding:0 6px; border-radius:999px; background:#f5b026; color:#2a1d00; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border:2px solid #f6f4f0;\">{{ needsN }}</span></button></sc-if>\n        <button onClick=\"{{ toAccount }}\" aria-label=\"Your account\" style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; display:grid; place-items:center; flex-shrink:0;\"><span style=\"width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; background:#0b0b0c; color:#f5b026; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600;\">{{ gIni }}</span></button>\n      </header>",
  "<div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ wd.tone }}; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; flex-shrink:0;\">{{ wd.ini }}</span><div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:{{ h1 }}; line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">{{ viewTitle }}</h1><span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:#6b6b72;\">{{ wd.name }} · {{ wd.meta }}</span></div></div>": "<div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\"><sc-if value=\"{{ wide }}\"><span style=\"width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ wd.tone }}; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; flex-shrink:0;\">{{ wd.ini }}</span></sc-if><div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:{{ h1 }}; line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">{{ viewTitle }}</h1><span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:#6b6b72;\">{{ wdMeta }}</span></div></div>",
  "<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"{{ subAria }}\" style=\"display:flex; gap:4px; padding:4px; background:#efede8; border-radius:14px; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:none;\">": "<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"{{ subAria }}\" style=\"display:flex; gap:4px; padding:4px; background:#efede8; border-radius:14px; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:none; position:sticky; top:8px; z-index:3; box-shadow:0 0 0 8px #f6f4f0;\">",
  "// upload": "The report upload: this host stores photos, not PDFs, for a family (photo_chunk_put); and no `capture`, because on Android it forces the camera and hides the gallery — where a report a school sent on WhatsApp already is.",
  "A clear photo of every page, or a PDF. Up to 10 MB.</span><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*,application/pdf\" capture=\"environment\"": "One clear photo of the report, with every subject and score in it.</span><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\"",
  "// tabs": "The active tab is a filled ink icon, an ink label and a short gold rule on the bar's top edge — one quiet mark, not a gold blob behind the icon.",
  "<button onClick=\"{{ t.onClick }}\" aria-current=\"{{ t.cur }}\" style=\"flex:1; min-height:54px; border:0; background:transparent; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:3px; position:relative; color:{{ t.c }};\"><span style=\"width:56px; height:30px; border-radius:999px; background:{{ t.pill }}; display:grid; place-items:center; transition:background .2s;\"><i class=\"{{ t.icon2 }}\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:22px;\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px; font-weight:{{ t.fw }};\">{{ t.short }}</span>": "<button onClick=\"{{ t.onClick }}\" aria-current=\"{{ t.cur }}\" style=\"flex:1; min-height:56px; border:0; background:transparent; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:2px; position:relative; color:{{ t.c }};\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute; top:-4px; left:50%; width:32px; height:3px; margin-left:-16px; border-radius:0 0 3px 3px; background:{{ t.pill }}; transition:background .2s;\"></span><span style=\"height:28px; display:grid; place-items:center;\"><i class=\"{{ t.icon2 }}\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:24px;\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:{{ t.fw }}; letter-spacing:.01em;\">{{ t.short }}</span>",
  "// account card": "Today's account card, cleaner: what is owed and its status at the top, one full-width Pay, the facts as a quiet list (label and why on the left, figure on the right) instead of tiles that wrapped a third onto its own row, and the statement as the card's own last row.",
  "<section aria-labelledby=\"acct-h\" style=\"background:#0b0b0c; color:#fff; border-radius:22px; padding:18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\"><i class=\"ph ph-wallet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:19px; color:#f5b026;\"></i><h2 id=\"acct-h\" style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; flex:1;\">{{ ac.h }}</h2><button onClick=\"{{ ac.toFees }}\" style=\"height:36px; padding:0 12px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-radius:10px; background:transparent; color:#fff; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">Statement<i class=\"ph ph-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n              <div style=\"flex:1 1 200px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; min-width:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);\">{{ ac.lab }}</span><span style=\"font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:{{ acFs }}; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">{{ ac.amount }}</span><span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.82); text-wrap:pretty;\">{{ ac.sub }}</span></div>\n              <sc-if value=\"{{ ac.canPay }}\"><button onClick=\"{{ ac.pay }}\" style=\"flex:0 1 auto; min-width:160px; height:48px; padding:0 18px; border:0; border-radius:14px; background:#f5b026; color:#2a1d00; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;\"><i class=\"ph ph-lock-simple\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>{{ ac.payL }}</button></sc-if>\n              <sc-if value=\"{{ ac.pending }}\"><span style=\"height:32px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:999px; background:#2a2108; color:#f8d98a; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><i class=\"ph ph-hourglass-medium\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>{{ ac.pendingL }}</span></sc-if>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 150px), 1fr)); gap:8px;\">\n              <sc-for list=\"{{ ac.facts }}\" as=\"f\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\"><div style=\"background:#1a1a1d; border-radius:14px; padding:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; min-width:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);\">{{ f.l }}</span><b style=\"font-size:15.5px; font-weight:600; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">{{ f.v }}</b><span style=\"font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.66); text-wrap:pretty;\">{{ f.s }}</span></div></sc-for>\n            </div>\n          </section>": "<section aria-labelledby=\"acct-h\" style=\"background:#0b0b0c; color:#fff; border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"padding:18px 18px 16px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;\">\n              <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\"><i class=\"ph ph-wallet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:18px; color:#f5b026;\"></i><h2 id=\"acct-h\" style=\"margin:0; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); flex:1;\">{{ ac.h }}</h2><span style=\"height:26px; padding:0 10px; border-radius:999px; background:{{ ac.labBg }}; color:{{ ac.labFg }}; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; white-space:nowrap;\">{{ ac.lab }}</span></div>\n              <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque', Geist, sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:{{ acFs }}; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">{{ ac.amount }}</span><span style=\"font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); text-wrap:pretty;\">{{ ac.sub }}</span></div>\n              <sc-if value=\"{{ ac.canPay }}\"><button onClick=\"{{ ac.pay }}\" style=\"min-height:52px; padding:0 18px; border:0; border-radius:14px; background:#f5b026; color:#2a1d00; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; width:100%;\"><i class=\"ph ph-lock-simple\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>{{ ac.payL }}</button></sc-if>\n              <sc-if value=\"{{ ac.pending }}\"><span role=\"status\" style=\"min-height:44px; padding:0 14px; border-radius:14px; background:#2a2108; color:#f8d98a; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\"><i class=\"ph ph-hourglass-medium\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>{{ ac.pendingL }}</span></sc-if>\n            </div>\n            <dl style=\"margin:0; background:#151517; display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n              <sc-for list=\"{{ ac.facts }}\" as=\"f\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\"><div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:12px 18px; border-top:1px solid #232326;\"><dt style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);\">{{ f.l }}</span><span style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.66); text-wrap:pretty;\">{{ f.s }}</span></dt><dd style=\"margin:0; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; text-align:right;\">{{ f.v }}</dd></div></sc-for>\n            </dl>\n            <button onClick=\"{{ ac.toFees }}\" style=\"min-height:48px; padding:0 18px; border:0; border-top:1px solid #232326; background:#151517; color:#fff; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\">See the statement<i class=\"ph ph-caret-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button>\n          </section>",
  "src=\"assets/logo.png\"": "src=\"/assets/logo.png\""
}
